                "text": "Opengrep Finding: resources.rules.raptor-format-string-bugs"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The software uses a function that accepts a format string as an argument, but the format string originates from an external source. This can lead  to buffer overflows, denial of service, or data representation problems."
